                    {
                        "Type": 7,
                        "Side": -2
                    }
                ],
                "Side": -2,
                "Value": 0
            },
            {
                "Name": "Clear tank hit",
                "Enabled": true,
                "Condition": 21,
                "Actions": [
                    {
                        "Type": 22,
                        "Trigger": "Tank hit"
                    }
                ],
                "Repeat": true,
                "Side": -2,
                "Count": 1
            },
            {
                "Name": "2.1 The city",
                "Enabled": true,
                "Condition": 0,
                "Actions": [
                    {
                        "Type": 1,
                        "TileX": 0,
                        "TileY": 0,
                        "Zoom": 0,
                        "Seconds": 1.0
                    },
                    {
                        "Type": 2,
                        "Marker": "Highlight",
                        "MarkerId": "city",
                        "Text": "",
                        "TileX": 0,
                        "TileY": 0
                    },
                    {
                        "Type": 0,
                        "Lines": [
                            {
                                "Character": "Anna",
                                "Text": "That's the city you want to seize, but be careful; he's got something up his sleeve.",
                                "Sound": "",
                                "Portrait": 0
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "Type": 3,
                        "MarkerId": "city"
                    }
                ]
            },
            {
                "Name": "2.2 The tank rides in",
                "Enabled": true,
                "Condition": 18,
                "Actions": [
                    {
                        "Type": 8,
                        "Side": 112,
                        "UnitKind": "Tank",
                        "TileX": 0,
                        "TileY": 0,
                        "Count": 1,
                        "Value": 6,
                        "Veterancy": 0,
                        "UnitTag": "Jori's Tank",
                        "ReadyToAct": true,
                        "OutOfSight": true
                    },
                    {
                        "Type": 26,
                        "UnitSide": 112,
                        "UnitTag": "Jori's Tank",
                        "Target": "{unit}",
                        "TargetSide": -2
                    },
                    {
                        "Type": 1,
                        "AtUnit": "Jori's Tank",
                        "Zoom": 0,
                        "Seconds": 0.8
                    },
                    {
                        "Type": 0,
                        "Lines": [
                            {
                                "Character": "Jori",
                                "Text": "Hah! Did you see that! That's what a real army looks like! Tanks are your worst nightmare.",
                                "Sound": "",
                                "Portrait": 0
                            },
                            {
                                "Character": "Anna",
                                "Text": "So that's what he was planning! It's a main battle tank. Grunts have little to no chance against that armour in the open.",
                                "Sound": "",
                                "Portrait": 0
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "Type": 17,
                        "Trigger": "2.3 That's a tank"
                    },
                    {
                        "Type": 17,
                        "Trigger": "2.4 Into the trees"
                    },
                    {
                        "Type": 17,
                        "Trigger": "2.8 Heavy fire"
                    },
                    {
                        "Type": 17,
                        "Trigger": "S1 Jori has no units"
                    }
                ],
                "Parts": [
                    "Jori's turn",
                    "Grunt near the city"
                ]
            },
            {
                "Name": "2.3 That's a tank",
                "Enabled": false,
                "Condition": 35,
                "Actions": [
                    {
                        "Type": 0,
                        "Lines": [
                            {
                                "Character": "Anna",
                                "Text": "That's a tank. When a unit's armour is higher than the attacker's piercing, the attacker's firepower is divided by the difference.",
                                "Sound": "",
                                "Portrait": 0
                            },
                            {
                                "Character": "Anna",
                                "Text": "Its armour is 4 and your rifles' piercing is 0, so your firepower of 3 is divided by 4: less than 1. Every attack does at least 1, so 1 is all your squads will take off it. Its gun has piercing 3 against your armour 0, so nothing is divided: in the open it takes 3 off a full squad.",
                                "Sound": "",
                                "Portrait": 0
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "Side": 112,
                "UnitTag": "Jori's Tank"
            },
            {
                "Name": "2.4 Into the trees",
                "Enabled": false,
                "Condition": 21,
                "Actions": [
                    {
                        "Type": 0,
                        "Lines": [
                            {
                                "Character": "Anna",
                                "Text": "We're not out of options. Tanks are strong but unwieldy and struggle to fight in areas with high concealment: forests and cities. Pull back to the forests nearby.",
                                "Sound": "",
                                "Portrait": 0
                            },
                            {
                                "Character": "Anna",
                                "Text": "Forests and hills are cover. Units are able to utilize different amounts of cover, and infantry are the best of all in it. When calculating damage, units in cover subtract the cover rating from the incoming attack, to a minimum of 1. Attackers never benefit from cover.",
                                "Sound": "",
                                "Portrait": 0
                            },
                            {
                                "Character": "Anna",
                                "Text": "A grunt in a forest or on a hill counts 2 points of cover, so a tank hits it for 2 instead of 3. A tank can only ever use 1 point of cover, wherever it stands.",
                                "Sound": "",
                                "Portrait": 0
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "Type": 22,
                        "Trigger": "Hunt turn"
                    },
                    {
                        "Type": 17,
                        "Trigger": "Cover marks"
                    },
                    {
                        "Type": 17,
                        "Trigger": "Cover marks cleared"
                    },
                    {
                        "Type": 17,
                        "Trigger": "Cover marks off"
                    },
