            {
                "Name": "2.5 Ambushed",
                "Enabled": false,
                "Condition": 37,
                "Actions": [
                    {
                        "Type": 0,
                        "Lines": [
                            {
                                "Character": "Jori",
                                "Text": "What the hell just happened?",
                                "Sound": "",
                                "Portrait": 0
                            },
                            {
                                "Character": "Anna",
                                "Text": "Did you see that? Your soldiers attacked first, because they were dug in cover - they can utilize more of the cover than the attacking unit. If you were ever attacking an enemy that was dug in and would ambush you, you would see a \"!\" next to the attack number.",
                                "Sound": "",
                                "Portrait": 0
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "Side": -2
            },
            {
                "Name": "2.6 See the \"!\"",
                "Enabled": true,
                "Condition": 36,
                "Actions": [
                    {
                        "Type": 0,
                        "Lines": [
                            {
                                "Character": "Anna",
                                "Text": "See the \"!\"? A defender fires first when its cover plus veterancy is higher than the attacker's concealment plus veterancy. I wouldn't attack that.",
                                "Sound": "",
                                "Portrait": 0
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "Side": -2,
                "UnitKind": "Tank",
                "Value": 1
            },
            {
                "Name": "2.7 Six numbers",
                "Enabled": false,
                "Condition": 21,
                "Actions": [
                    {
                        "Type": 0,
                        "Lines": [
                            {
                                "Character": "Anna",
                                "Text": "Every unit has six numbers that decide a fight: click it and open More on its card to see them. Firepower is how hard it hits; veterancy adds to it. Armour divides incoming fire by however much it exceeds the attacker's piercing. Evasion divides it again by however much it exceeds the attacker's targeting.",
                                "Sound": "",
                                "Portrait": 0
                            },
                            {
                                "Character": "Anna",
                                "Text": "Concealment is how much of a tile's cover the unit can use: 3 for a grunt, 1 for a tank. Then the cover is subtracted, the result is scaled by the attacker's strength out of 6 and rounded down, never below 1. The number over each unit before you fire is exactly what will happen.",
                                "Sound": "",
                                "Portrait": 0
                            },
                            {
                                "Character": "Jori",
                                "Text": "My armor is tough enough to shrug off your attacks!",
                                "Sound": "",
                                "Portrait": 0
                            },
                            {
                                "Character": "Anna",
                                "Text": "Not quite. As long as a unit is able to attack, it deals at a minimum 1 damage. You have three infantry nearby, which means at least 3 damage. Meanwhile he's wounded, so he won't be doing as much damage in return!",
                                "Sound": "",
                                "Portrait": 0
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "Type": 22,
                        "Trigger": "Two turns since the lesson"
                    },
                    {
                        "Type": 17,
                        "Trigger": "Counterattack made"
                    },
                    {
                        "Type": 17,
                        "Trigger": "2.10 Anna's gift"
                    }
                ],
                "Side": -2,
                "Count": 1
            },
